From 74a87c662b642aeaa5c7bdaff16bf3cf3e2bf6fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:42:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(examples): make the first-router-part program again after
 the repeated-tool change

PR #3464 (issue #3445) makes the grbl-family posts skip the tool call of a repeated tool. The shipped example kept the second `T2 M6` of the section "2D Contour1", so the example was stale and main was red.

Fixes #3572

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 examples/first-router-part.nc | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/examples/first-router-part.nc b/examples/first-router-part.nc
index 3f81a40b9..9f485f77b 100644
--- a/examples/first-router-part.nc
+++ b/examples/first-router-part.nc
@@ -79,7 +79,6 @@ M5
 G17 G90 G54 G40 G80
 (T2 EM-0600-4FL - FLAT END MILL D6)
 G53 G0 Z0
-T2 M6
 S9500 M3
 G0 Z15
 G0 X173.514 Y24.198
